{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>She lives on your desktop. She studies, sings, and smiles \u2014 just for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Desktop Akari ~my cute companion~</strong></i> is a unique blend of idle sim, raising sim, and desktop companion \u2014 starring Akari, your sweet and hardworking virtual girlfriend who lives right on your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/extras/d32115c3cae03f3fe81915555c52e22f.webp?t=1760988316\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/extras/d32115c3cae03f3fe81915555c52e22f.poster.webp?t=1760988316\" class=\"bb_img\" width=599 height=374 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch her walk, read, chat with friends, and sing her heart out as she tries to grow in every way she can. Help her with her homework, cheer her up when she's down, and guide her as she works toward her dream of becoming a singer. Every interaction counts \u2014 the more time you spend together, the more she opens up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/extras/4c8df6b75694d5e7d743579d32c304d1.webp?t=1760988316\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/extras/4c8df6b75694d5e7d743579d32c304d1.poster.webp?t=1760988316\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=472 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each date is a milestone \u2014 and Akari is determined to become the best version of herself with every one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s always there, quietly living her own life beside yours. But she\u2019s not just a program \u2014 she\u2019s Akari, and she wants to make you smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/extras/51970101e39efac362fea442a99c354f.webp?t=1760988316\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/extras/51970101e39efac362fea442a99c354f.poster.webp?t=1760988316\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=459 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Desktop Akari ~my cute companion~</strong></i>\u00a0is a real-time desktop companion game. Watch Akari live on your screen, assign her tasks, earn hearts, and help her grow. Balance study, singing, and friendship to unlock upgrades and dates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702590?t=1760988316","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/9deb1c0e8111665b497f3c0f121ec4225d1c6ed6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760988316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/4e2f1e76c82ff1fa8966fd32a8f3c242298b12f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760988316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/4e2f1e76c82ff1fa8966fd32a8f3c242298b12f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760988316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>She lives on your desktop. She studies, sings, and smiles \u2014 just for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Desktop Akari ~my cute companion~</strong></i> is a unique blend of idle sim, raising sim, and desktop companion \u2014 starring Akari, your sweet and hardworking virtual girlfriend who lives right on your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta