ari live on your screen, assign her tasks, earn hearts, and help her grow. Balance study, singing, and friendship to unlock upgrades and dates.</p>","developers":["TERNOX"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702590/31e87ec37f6648e76d4eae0605104c0d0874e89c/header.jpg?t=1760988316","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"You are free to stream my game and create video content featuring it. Please include a link to the game in the description.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702590/1739634055/875158d2feeb0d46d9dea60a8ca78a55c0e88bac/1754774582/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755190659","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702590/1739634055/875158d2feeb0d46d9dea60a8ca78a55c0e88bac/1754774582/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755190659","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702590/1739634055/875158d2feeb0d46d9dea60a8ca78a55c0e88bac/1754774582/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755190659","id":257180925,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180925/movie480.mp4?t=1755190659","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180925/movie_max.mp4?t=1755190659"},"name":"Desktop Akari","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180925/1ed8b797ae6adb56bdfb1facba11c5e2876eca00/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755190659","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180925/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755190659","max":"https://video.akamai.steam